{"type":"message","id":"844c5e56","parentId":"ae7022e9","timestamp":"2026-03-20T05:26:55.819Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I need to analyze the situation:\n\n1. **Current time**: Friday, March 20th, 2026 — 1:24 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n2. **No-disturb condition**: 23:00-08:00 - This time (1:24 PM) is **outside** the no-disturb period\n3. **Last update**: 11:54 AM (1.5 hours ago)\n\nThe \"不打扰条件\" says: \"30 分钟内刚检查过同类项目\" - Since the last update was at 11:54 AM (1.5 hours ago), this rule no longer applies.\n\nNow I need to follow the \"检查顺序\" (check order):\n1. Look at `memory/heartbeat-state.json` ✓ (done)\n2. Prioritize checking items that are furthest from last check and most valuable\n\nFrom the JSON:\n- email: 1773824000 (old timestamp)\n- calendar: 1773824000 (old timestamp)\n- weather: 1773916440 (more recent)\n- mentions: null (never checked)\n\nThe mentions field has never been checked (null), which means it's the item that's furthest from last check (never checked). According to USER.md, the user wants \"重要事项：立即通知\" (important matters: notify immediately), so checking mentions could be valuable.\n\nHowever, I don't have the tool to check mentions (or email, calendar, weather). Looking at my available tools, I don't see a mentions checker or email checker.\n\nLet me consider the \"主动提醒条件\" (active reminder conditions):\n- 未来 2 小时内有日程 (Future 2 hours have schedules)? - No calendar access\n- 收到明显重要/紧急的新消息 (Received important/urgent new messages)? - No email/mentions access\n- 距离上次主动汇报已超过 8 小时，且确实有新信息 (Last proactive reachout was over 8 hours ago and there's new information)?\n  - `lastProactiveReachoutAt`: 1773885240\n  - Current time is approximately 1773925440 (1:24 PM UTC+8)\n  - 1773925440 - 1773885240 = 40200 seconds = 11.17 hours\n  - So it's been over 11 hours since last proactive reachout!\n  - But I cannot verify if there's \"新信息\" (new information)\n\nThe condition requires \"且确实有新信息\" (and there truly is new information), which I cannot verify without checking the actual items.\n\nLooking at the \"不打扰条件\": \"没有任何新增信息\" (no new information) - I cannot confirm if there's new information or not.\n\nSince I don't have the tools to check the actual heartbeat items, and there's no clear indication of urgent matters needing attention, I should return `HEARTBEAT_OK`.\n\nHowever, let me check if there's a \"weather\" skill I could use. Looking at the available skills, there is a \"weather\" skill. Let me try to use it:\n\nActually, wait - I should first check if I should use a skill. According to the instructions, I should read a skill's file when the task matches its description. The weather skill description is \"Get current weather and forecasts\".\n\nSince checking weather is mentioned in HEARTBEAT.md as one of the items to check, and I haven't checked weather recently (last weather check was timestamp 1773916440), I should check the weather.\n\nLet me read the weather skill file:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_82yjv9yo5fo5xi1zilaqqsbv","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":38279,"output":795,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39074,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773984295956}}
{"type":"message","id":"1154800a","parentId":"844c5e56","timestamp":"2026-03-20T05:26:55.827Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_82yjv9yo5fo5xi1zilaqqsbv","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌤️\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"curl\"]}}}\n---\n\n# Weather\n\nTwo free services, no API keys needed.\n\n## wttr.in (primary)\n\nQuick one-liner:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C\n```\n\nCompact format:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C 71% ↙5km/h\n```\n\nFull forecast:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?T\"\n```\n\nFormat codes: `%c` condition · `%t` temp · `%h` humidity · `%w` wind · `%l` location · `%m` moon\n\nTips:\n- URL-encode spaces: `wttr.in/New+York`\n- Airport codes: `wttr.in/JFK`\n- Units: `?m` (metric) `?u` (USCS)\n- Today only: `?1` · Current only: `?0`\n- PNG: `curl -s \"wttr.in/Berlin.png\" -o /tmp/weather.png`\n\n## Open-Meteo (fallback, JSON)\n\nFree, no key, good for programmatic use:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=51.5&longitude=-0.12&current_weather=true\"\n```\n\nFind coordinates for a city, then query. Returns JSON with temp, windspeed, weathercode.\n\nDocs: https://open-meteo.com/en/docs\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773984415824}}
