 the \"检查顺序\" (check order):\n1. Look at `memory/heartbeat-state.json` ✓ (done)\n2. Prioritize checking items that are furthest from last check and most valuable\n\nFrom the JSON:\n- email: 1773824000 (old timestamp - March 2025)\n- calendar: 1773824000 (old timestamp - March 2025)\n- weather: 1773925440 (checked 2 hours ago - showed normal weather: Shanghai ⛅️ +16°C)\n- mentions: null (never checked)\n\nThe email and calendar have timestamps from March 2025 (over a year ago). The mentions field has never been checked (null). These are the items furthest from last check.\n\nHowever, I don't have the tools to check email, calendar, or mentions. Looking at my available tools, I don't see email checker, calendar checker, or mentions checker.\n\nLet me consider the \"主动提醒条件\" (active reminder conditions):\n- 未来 2 小时内有日程 (Future 2 hours have schedules)? - No calendar access, can't check\n- 收到明显重要/紧急的新消息 (Received important/urgent new messages)? - No email/mentions access, can't check\n- 距离上次主动汇报已超过 8 小时，且确实有新信息 (Last proactive reachout was over 8 hours ago and there's new information)? \n  - `lastProactiveReachoutAt`: 1773885240 (12.5+ hours ago)\n  - But I cannot verify if there's new information without checking\n- 发现需要尽快处理的异常 (Found anomalies needing immediate attention)? - The old timestamps for email/calendar are anomalous, but I can't check them\n\nSince I don't have the tools to check the actual heartbeat items, and I can't verify if there's urgent new information, I should return `HEARTBEAT_OK`.\n\nHEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":221,"output":1193,"cacheRead":43136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44550,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773992091839}}
